@startuml
participant Client
participant API
participant "Request Metrics Middleware" as Metrics
participant "JSON Logger" as Logger
participant Prometheus
participant "Central Log Store" as Logs
Client -> API: request
API -> Metrics: method, route group, status, duration
API -> Logger: redacted event + correlation context
Metrics --> Prometheus: protected /metrics scrape
Logger --> Logs: structured JSON
Prometheus -> Prometheus: evaluate alert rules
note right of Logger
No raw prompts, document bodies,
API keys, passwords, cookies,
or provider payloads.
end note
@enduml
